  "description": "Privacy-first analytics for .NET apps and games on desktop, mobile and console. Send named events with an optional number and a few properties and see them in the MightyS Pulse dashboard. No device IDs, anonymous hashed install id, optional user id hashed on the device, offline queue on disk. Targets netstandard2.0 and net8.0 with no package dependencies.",
