  "releaseNotes": "Every signal now carries device, app, language, time zone and usage fields with no setup, plus three automatic signals: pulse.session_started, pulse.new_install and pulse.app_updated. Apps can add screen size, colour scheme and similar values through PulsePlatformOptions.HostFields.",
